      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Instead of focusing on shortcomings, frame the excellent current results as a strong foundation that warrants advanced protection. You can suggest that while their current posture is strong, \"Advanced Continuous Monitoring\" provides predictive threat detection unavailable in their current tier. This positions the upgrade as an evolution from \"secure\" to \"future-proof,\" which appeals to proactive risk management.",
